    "description": "The Terrestrial Ecology Subsetting & Visualization Services (TESViS) Fixed Sites Subsets Tool provides customized subsets and visualizations of several terrestrial ecology data products for 2000+ selected field and flux tower sites around the world. Spatial subsets of the land products are available for predefined areas (approximately 8.5 by 8.5-km) centered on each site. Users select a site and data product through the graphical web interface and are directed to a page with options for data download and visualizations.",
